values ('torso-bronchi', 'torso', 'respiratory', 'Bronchi and bronchial tree', null, null, 2, 'The trachea splits into bronchi, which branch again and again into smaller bronchioles that lead to the alveoli.', 'Bronchioles have smooth muscle. Sympathetic (beta-2) signals relax it and widen the airways, which is how asthma inhalers work.')
