values ('torso-right-lung', 'torso', 'respiratory', 'Right lung', null, null, 3, 'The right lung has three lobes. Gas exchange happens by diffusion across the thin walls of millions of alveoli.', 'Right lung: 3 lobes; left lung: 2 lobes, leaving room for the heart. Inhaled objects more often lodge in the right main bronchus, which is wider and more vertical.')
