values ('torso-left-lung', 'torso', 'respiratory', 'Left lung', null, null, 4, 'The left lung has two lobes and a notch where the heart sits. Like the right lung, its alveoli are where oxygen enters and carbon dioxide leaves the blood.', 'Surfactant from type II alveolar cells lowers surface tension so alveoli don''t collapse. Premature babies may lack enough surfactant.')
